# Shared supplier and customer ABox fixture (MEDULLA-SUPPLY-VOCAB-R003.15).
#
# Instances typed by the shared kg# classes the commercial module must not
# redeclare or narrow: the Supplier IRI owned by supply_chain-v1.ttl (itself a
# specialist of trm :Vendor) and the Customer IRI shared with ERPNext. These
# instances stay valid against the commercial module's declarations.

@prefix : <http://knuckles.team/kg#> .
@prefix ex: <http://knuckles.team/test/commercial#> .

ex:acmeSupplier a :Supplier .

ex:acmeCustomer a :Customer .
